pure, pale undulating bliss today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RATSHAKER\u2122</strong> features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAT</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Redacted</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Removed</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Expunged</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive <strong>RAT</strong> Shaking Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Environments </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revelation<strong>  </strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No real rats were harmed in the development of <strong>RATSHAKER\u2122.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290710/extras/a3a2418a89af3d2a9a933b328f47a078.avif?t=1751896772\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
